MAIN
MOVE TEMP 13 4
MOVE TEMP 14 HALLOCATE TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 15 8
MOVE TEMP 16 HALLOCATE TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 17 A_foo
HSTORE TEMP 3 0 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 A_start
HSTORE TEMP 3 4 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 19 TEMP 3
HSTORE TEMP 2 0 TEMP 19
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 2
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 1 0
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 4 4
MOVE TEMP 20 CALL TEMP 5 ( TEMP 1 )
PRINT TEMP 20
END
A_start [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 0
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 8 0
MOVE TEMP 21 CALL TEMP 9 ( TEMP 7 )
HLOAD TEMP 6 TEMP 21 0
PRINT TEMP 6
MOVE TEMP 22 0

RETURN TEMP 22
END
A_foo [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 23 5
MOVE TEMP 10 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 24 1
MOVE TEMP 25 PLUS TEMP 10 TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 26 4
MOVE TEMP 27 TIMES TEMP 25 TEMP 26
MOVE TEMP 28 HALLOCATE TEMP 27
MOVE TEMP 11 TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 29 4
MOVE TEMP 12 TEMP 29
L0 MOVE TEMP 30 4
MOVE TEMP 31 TIMES TEMP 10 TEMP 30
MOVE TEMP 32 LE TEMP 12 TEMP 31
CJUMP TEMP 32 L1
MOVE TEMP 33 PLUS TEMP 11 TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 34 0
MOVE TEMP 35 TEMP 34
HSTORE TEMP 33 0 TEMP 35
MOVE TEMP 36 4
MOVE TEMP 37 PLUS TEMP 12 TEMP 36
MOVE TEMP 12 TEMP 37
JUMP L0
L1 MOVE TEMP 38 TEMP 10
HSTORE TEMP 11 0 TEMP 38

RETURN TEMP 11
END

